{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:627f44a03c76e65b","name":"Tractor Beam","source":{"id":"source:reference-627f44a03c76e65b","title":"Tractor Beam","revision":18571,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:20:21Z","sha256":"90170035c04aa20d636a95a23e3a5c077622206d4e2a8dbb0b6a6009b3eae499","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18571","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tractor%20Beam&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-627f44a03c76e65b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Massive devices that require enormous outlays of energy to operate, Tractor Beams are generally found only on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Stations"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Stations","referenceId":"reference:65763f09c9074f45"},". Tractor Beams are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonstandard Modifications"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonstandard_Modifications"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", making such installations almost impossible for all but the best engineers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Instead of Damaging a Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", Tractor Beams prevent another Vehicle from escaping. When making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Attack"}," with a Tractor Beam, your attack hits if you equal or exceed the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If you hit, make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check. If you win the opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check, the target is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"},". If a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," target is of your Vehicle's size or smaller, then it cannot move, and it loses its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". Each round on your turn, you must make another opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check; if you win the opposed check, you may pull the target up to 10 squares closer to you (or 1 square closer to you in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},"), or hold it in place in its current square. If you lose the opposed check, the target manages to slip free from the Tractor Beam.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," target is larger than your Vehicle, the target retains its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", and can move freely, but you may move your Vehicle up to 10 squares closer to it (or 1 square closer to it in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},"). If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," Vehicle ever moves beyond the Range of your Tractor Beam, the Tractor Beam's hold is broken automatically.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you pull your target into your square (or pull your Vehicle into a larger target's square), your Vehicle may use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Docking Clamps"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Docking_Clamps","referenceId":"reference:b4a9e9f91fcb2a40"}," to attach itself to the target. Once this is done, it is possible to board the target ship by blowing open, or cutting through, an airlock of the hull (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack an Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_an_Object","referenceId":"reference:caaf24587149e3b5"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Tractor Beam Ranges\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RANGE BY CHARACTER SCALE\n"],"colspan":4},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":3},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n",{"tag":"p","children":["RANGE BY STARSHIP SCALE\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0-150 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["151-300 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["301-750 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["751-1,500 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0-1 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3-5 Squares\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["6-10 Squares\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
